 "_doc": "LED strip (MB2WS, device type 120) effect catalogue for voice commands and integrations: the `effect` control (FxId, holding 405) takes `id`. Names are copied from www/network_config/static/js/flasher/led.js (LED_T rgbw_fx_NN / rgbw_fx_grp_*), ids and groups from opt/sa02m-led/sa02m_led/led_mb2ws_map.py (RGBW_FX_MODE_COUNT, RGBW_FX_GROUP_RANGES); opt/sa02m-led/tests/test_effects_catalogue.py fails on any drift. Contract: docs/contracts/led-mb2ws.md section 4.",
